{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0423_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f60e8e40ee4832a1cf703660eaf590ae00d4472de96d198571dbbb338457fba0", "ja": "（ジュリアのグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影は\n順調に終わった。いい雰囲気で撮影できていたな！）", "zh": "（茱莉亚为写真杂志《偶像写真！！》进行的拍摄顺利结束了。今天的拍摄氛围真不错啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0423_1001_050jul", "source_sha256": "242347da614f055e411a1658b5e6187b9e7bc27881f1528f15a23009a5c6e7ed", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れ。\n今日の撮影、なかなかいい感じじゃなかったか？", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了。\n今天的拍摄，感觉还挺不错的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0423_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b31fd1afa6d7ee0d2e22ac374bf5a758d6753b27811e9913045f7a0b19b369f8", "ja": "ああ、バッチリだ。それにしても、ジュリア。\n撮影中は、ずいぶん落ち着いてたな？", "zh": "啊，完美。话说回来，茱莉亚。\n拍摄时，你还挺安静的嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0423_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "d97ddfeb674c76be3c055fe0eaf6dec0501f0887a13e9da225cc4148bc65e2e1", "ja": "はあ！？　……おい、{$P$}。\nそれじゃ、いつもうるさいみたいじゃないか。", "zh": "哈！？……喂，{$P$}。你这么说，听起来就好像我平时总是吵吵闹闹似的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0423_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "aa006297b97467a03de0d34f9003e5843289d0a59c0ec71a7bcacf629597c144", "ja": "ていうか、こんなイイ衣装を貰ったんだ。衣装に合った\n雰囲気で応えるのが、ロックってもんだろ。", "zh": "话说回来，既然收到了这么棒的服装，就该用符合服装的氛围来回应，这才叫摇滚吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0423_1005_p", "source_sha256": "07333bd6fb924d5f41bf00a661b96432ef70a8aafb2d5daecc84834125577fea", "ja": "おお。確かにロックだな！", "zh": "哦，确实很摇滚啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0423_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "61377080d1ddba7d474f26a4667f022d5c281194668da9a0d2a36b600aed0a7d", "ja": "だろ？　……意外かもしれないけど。\nこれ着てると、いいフレーズが浮かんでくるんだ。", "zh": "对吧？……可能让你觉得挺意外的。\n穿着这个，就会浮现出不错的乐句。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0423_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "38d00a690b12628eb12c6da83fec945bfb69e22a094acde2e476047c19d4124e", "ja": "なんだろう……リラックスできるからかな。\nいつもと違うメロディが浮かんだりしてさ……。", "zh": "不知怎么说……可能是因为穿着它能让人放松吧。\n有时还会浮现出和平时不一样的旋律……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0423_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "2feb1095140bb974835400e4333b0ae60984b7049a14ddf61aadef293874dd7b", "ja": "……なぁ、{$P$}。", "zh": "……怎么说呢，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0423_1009_p", "source_sha256": "7c59608752f267d6180b140d18e7d63d6eab88ec8f53b1bf3132cb2afda45b46", "ja": "うん？", "zh": "嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0423_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "5e5cd0219a4122724d35c47fd8cae4eca56adf670798872b3e74711129f6b7ff", "ja": "このパジャマで、ライブしてもいいかな？\nセトリも、子守歌とか落ち着いた曲を多めにしてさ。", "zh": "穿着这身睡衣开演唱会，可以吗？\n歌单也多安排一些摇篮曲之类的舒缓歌曲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0423_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "ffa7def97ef7f69f7356538815142b70bacb70807f2bd5e3acac9093e34390fd", "ja": "グラビアだけで終わりじゃ、その、勿体ないだろ？", "zh": "如果只拍写真就结束了，那不是太可惜了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0423_1012_p", "source_sha256": "7f93ba4429306020889375963c19e07c97485f8db655f7affbd9a3c0046ad54e", "ja": "ジュリア……。\nそうだな。ジュリアの提案、社長達に相談してみるよ。", "zh": "茱莉亚……。\n\n确实如此。我去和社长他们商量一下茱莉亚的提议。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0423_1013_050jul", "source_sha256": "85f04a8a78686189e4ae4c8cf1176d4d1f0dd543c03d2c076a0889b7255aa998", "ja": "やっぱあんたは話が分かるぜ！　へへっ。\nライブが決まったら、覚悟しろよ？", "zh": "果然还是你懂我！嘿嘿。\n演唱会要是定下来了，你可做好心理准备啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0423_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "c4d503cf0c6395f7a300cf1aeb6eacfec6b214574aa30278a4e1522cfe7d1df6", "ja": "このパジャマと子守歌で、ファンのみんなやあんたを\n沸かせ……いや、寝かせてやるからな！", "zh": "用这套睡衣和摇篮曲，让粉丝们和你兴奋起来……不对，是哄你们睡觉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
